  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Bastion server",
      "source_hash": 7032132949222327877,
      "context_hash": 545863660285429767,
      "translation": "Bastion 서버",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bastion": "bastion"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:15.196374Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "FQDN: `bastion.infra.rust-lang.org`",
      "source_hash": 8672914525253358947,
      "context_hash": 4164303984220118613,
      "translation": "FQDN: `bastion.infra.rust-lang.org`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637656Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "[Ansible playbook][ansible] to deploy this server.",
      "source_hash": 10891866672834265623,
      "context_hash": 17712000524030812752,
      "translation": "이 서버를 배포하기 위한 [Ansible 플레이북][ansible]입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637656Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "[Terraform configuration][terraform] to create AWS resources.",
      "source_hash": 13571615781798026603,
      "context_hash": 17434487124037123527,
      "translation": "AWS 리소스를 생성하기 위한 [Terraform 설정][terraform]입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637656Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "[Instance metrics][grafana] (only available to infra team members).",
      "source_hash": 10707949832491846195,
      "context_hash": 18042010590661207235,
      "translation": "[인스턴스 메트릭][grafana](인프라 팀 구성원만 이용 가능합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637656Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Logging into servers through the bastion",
      "source_hash": 8241549138984112857,
      "context_hash": 3966130267985952488,
      "translation": "Bastion을 통해 서버에 로그인하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bastion": "bastion"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:15.196375Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "To improve the security of our infrastructure it's not possible to connect directly to a production server with SSH.",
      "source_hash": 9133473364054668866,
      "context_hash": 11347945877311620231,
      "translation": "인프라 보안을 향상시키기 위해 프로덕션 서버에 SSH로 직접 연결할 수 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Instead, all connections must come from a small server called the \"bastion\", which only allows connections from a few whitelisted networks and logs any connection attempt.",
      "source_hash": 10943140622096879109,
      "context_hash": 10202985454860254360,
      "translation": "대신, 모든 연결은 \"bastion\"이라고 불리는 소규모 서버를 거쳐야 하며, 이 서버는 화이트리스트에 등록된 소수의 네트워크에서 오는 연결만 허용하고 모든 연결 시도를 기록합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bastion": "bastion"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:15.196375Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "To log into a server through the bastion, use one of the following methods:",
      "source_hash": 10797355568025581177,
      "context_hash": 3405158176179229436,
      "translation": "Bastion을 통해 서버에 로그인하려면 다음 방법 중 하나를 사용하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bastion": "bastion"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:15.196375Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Use SSH's `-J` flag:",
      "source_hash": 10383389546267845623,
      "context_hash": 8952554232511907039,
      "translation": "SSH의 `-J` 플래그를 사용하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Configure your SSH client to always jump through the bastion when connecting to a host:",
      "source_hash": 9601649494012048416,
      "context_hash": 16866837342187620359,
      "translation": "호스트에 연결할 때 항상 bastion을 거치도록 SSH 클라이언트를 설정하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bastion": "bastion"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:15.196375Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Add this snippet to your SSH configuration file (usually located in `~/.ssh/config`):",
      "source_hash": 2635953753507604589,
      "context_hash": 75521009948728406,
      "translation": "SSH 설정 파일(보통 `~/.ssh/config`에 위치)에 다음 스니펫을 추가하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Use SSH:",
      "source_hash": 18014569372166840268,
      "context_hash": 1468055189530258899,
      "translation": "SSH를 사용하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "The SSH keys authorized to log into each account are stored in the [simpleinfra repository][keys].",
      "source_hash": 6028330400902628908,
      "context_hash": 10813507712351298108,
      "translation": "각 계정에 로그인할 수 있도록 승인된 SSH 키는 [simpleinfra 저장소][keys]에 저장되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "Additionally, people with sensitive 1password access can use the master key stored in the vault to log into every account.",
      "source_hash": 12511035557997160447,
      "context_hash": 12647020196788460386,
      "translation": "또한 민감한 1password 접근 권한이 있는 사람들은 볼트에 저장된 마스터 키를 사용하여 모든 계정에 로그인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Common maintenance procedures",
      "source_hash": 1250972913712992444,
      "context_hash": 16976068835924863241,
      "translation": "일반적인 유지 관리 절차",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637658Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Adding a new user to the bastion server",
      "source_hash": 10325184625607100062,
      "context_hash": 12963912343638909668,
      "translation": "Bastion 서버에 새 사용자 추가하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bastion": "bastion"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:15.196376Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "To add a new user to the bastion you need to add its key to a file named `<username>.pub` in [`ansible/roles/common/files/ssh-keys`][keys], and change the [Ansible playbook][ansible] adding the user to the list of unprivileged users.",
      "source_hash": 8966113376677502747,
      "context_hash": 2600642088831473116,
      "translation": "Bastion에 새 사용자를 추가하려면 [`ansible/roles/common/files/ssh-keys`][keys]에 `<username>.pub`라는 이름의 파일로 해당 사용자의 키를 추가하고, [Ansible playbook][ansible]을 수정하여 해당 사용자를 비특권 사용자 목록에 추가해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bastion": "bastion"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:15.196376Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Please leave a comment clarifying which servers the user will have access to.",
      "source_hash": 14357803111398839902,
      "context_hash": 12080298213223423394,
      "translation": "해당 사용자가 어떤 서버에 접근할 수 있는지를 명확히 하는 코멘트를 남겨 주십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637658Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Once that's done [apply the playbook][ansible-apply].",
      "source_hash": 15104455696214866951,
      "context_hash": 6950180630160050364,
      "translation": "그 작업이 끝나면 [플레이북을 적용하십시오][ansible-apply].",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:44:56.637658Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}